Description: Native PC health monitor with interactive autohealing
 VitaHeal is a Debian-native GTK4 desktop application that monitors CPU,
 memory, disk, temperature, GPU (NVIDIA/AMD/Intel), network and process
 health. When a critical fault is detected it pops up a Yes/No dialog
 before performing any autoheal action. Ships with a systemd user daemon,
 polkit helper and .desktop launcher so it installs and runs with the OS
 — not a web app.
